immediately about

988
01:03:12.640 --> 01:03:14.960
all of the possible challenges
over the days.

989
01:03:18.600 --> 01:03:19.560
[COMMENTATOR]:
Mo Salah.

990
01:03:21.920 --> 01:03:24.240
[CROWD CHEERS]

991
01:03:27.960 --> 01:03:30.520
[KLOPP]: It's for me difficult
to describe things I do as work.

992
01:03:31.080 --> 01:03:32.480
Work are other things for me.

993
01:03:34.440 --> 01:03:37.240
If I only have to bring out
the bin at home

994
01:03:37.320 --> 01:03:38.320
that's work.

995
01:03:39.200 --> 01:03:41.200
I like preparing
training sessions.

996
01:03:41.360 --> 01:03:43.840
I like analysing football games.

997
01:03:44.120 --> 01:03:45.440
I cannot describe it as work.

998
01:03:45.520 --> 01:03:47.520
So if nobody
would pay me for that

999
01:03:47.600 --> 01:03:48.800
I would love to do it anyway.

1000
01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:51.720
So, thank God they pay me,
not too bad on top.

1001
01:03:58.320 --> 01:03:59.320
[THEY LAUGH]

1002
01:03:59.520 --> 01:04:02.000
Maybe that's the description
of a workaholic. I don't know.

1003
01:04:03.160 --> 01:04:05.640
My wife would say 100%.
I'm pretty sure.

1004
01:04:06.120 --> 01:04:09.560
[CROWD CHANTS]: ♪ We shall not,
we shall not be moved ♪

1005
01:04:09.760 --> 01:04:11.600
[COMMENTATOR]:
The reds of United

1006
01:04:11.680 --> 01:04:13.840
unable to halt the march...

1007
01:04:14.440 --> 01:04:15.600
...that will surely lead...

1008
01:04:16.240 --> 01:04:18.760
to Liverpool winning
a nineteenth title.

1009
01:04:19.680 --> 01:04:22.280
[CROWD CHANTS]: ♪ We shall not,
we shall not be moved ♪

1010
01:04:22.520 --> 01:04:23.400
Mysterious...

1011
01:04:24.320 --> 01:04:25.520
Pneumonia outbreak...

1012
01:04:26.360 --> 01:04:27.360
In China...

1013
01:04:28.800 --> 01:04:30.040
Coronavirus.

1014
01:04:40.240 --> 01:04:43.680
[SPEAKS MANDARIN]:

1015
01:05:15.160 --> 01:05:16.640
[COMMENTATOR]: It's West Ham
who will get us underway

1016
01:05:16.720 --> 01:05:18.480
with their captain Mark Noble.

1017
01:05:26.320 --> 01:05:28.520
[COMMENTATOR]: And it's towards
Ogbonna

1018
01:05:28.600 --> 01:05:30.240
and it could be turned
in as well.

1019
01:05:43.640 --> 01:05:45.520
[COMMENTATOR]: Oh, it might
come for Alexander-Arnold.

1020
01:05:45.640 --> 01:05:51.320
It will, and in by Sadio Mane!
Liverpool from behind.

1021
01:06:23.720 --> 01:06:25.520
[COMMENTATOR]: Liverpool
are twelve points away

1022
01:06:25.600 --> 01:06:26.840
from the promised land

1023
01:06:27.400 --> 01:06:30.320
from the ultimate glory
in English football.

1024
01:06:31.240 --> 01:06:32.320
They could do it in draws

1025
01:06:32.400 --> 01:06:34.080
with the games remaining
in the season.

1026
01:06:34.160 --> 01:06:35.480
They'd like to do it in wins

1027
01:06:35.840 --> 01:06:39.080
and they'd like to start
with a victory at Watford.

1028
01:06:40.560 --> 01:06:43.640
Changes tonight for Liverpool
come in midfield.

1029
01:06:43.760 --> 01:06:46.440
Jordan Henderson is ruled out
through injury.

1030
01:06:48.200 --> 01:06:50.080
[HENDERSON]: Injuries
are so hard to deal with.

1031
01:06:50.840 --> 01:06:52.240
I don't mind
playing through pain.

1032
01:06:52.320 --> 01:06:53.520
As long as I'm out there,
I'm fine.

1033
01:06:55.160 --> 01:06:57.760
The tough part for me is when
you're actually on the side-line

1034
01:06:58.040 --> 01:07:01.480
because I can't affect
and help the team.

1035
01:07:03.360 --> 01:07:04.400
[VAN DIJK]:
It was a big blow

1036
01:07:04.480 --> 01:07:06.880
massive, because the energy
he brings in the game

1037
01:07:06.960 --> 01:07:08.680
the feistiness at times.

1038
01:07:09.080 --> 01:07:10.480
That's something that
we definitely miss.

1039
01:07:12.680 --> 01:07:13.680
[WHISTLE BLOWS]

1040
01:07:19.320 --> 01:07:21.560
[COMMENTATOR]:
Doucoure stole in and Sarr!

1041
01:07:22.040 --> 01:07:22.920
Goal!
[CROWD CHEERS]

1042
01:07:23.280 --> 01:07:26.960
And a shadow of a doubt
is cast over

1043
01:07:27.040 --> 01:07:30.160
Liverpool's cloak
of invincibility.

1044
01:07:30.480 --> 01:07:31.480
[VAN DIJK]:
We didn't play well.

1045
01:07:34.080 --> 01:07:36.760
We had the ball so,
like for so many percentage

1046
01:07:37.400 --> 01:07:38.480
but we couldn't create.

1047
01:07:41.680 --> 01:07:42.960
[COMMENTATOR]:
Nicely done by Hughes.

1048
01:07:43.440 --> 01:07:45.360
And Sarr is away.

1049
01:07:46.080 --> 01:07:47.800
And this is a big moment!

1050
01:07:49.160 --> 01:07:53.120
It's two for Watford.
It's two for Ismaila Sarr.

1051
01:07:53.200 --> 01:07:56.000
[CROWD CHEERS]

1052
01:08:00.280 --> 01:08:01.600
[VAN DIJK]:
I don't think it was pressure.

1053
01:08:02.440 --> 01:08:03.680
Some things didn't go our way

1054
01:08:03.760 --> 01:08:05.800
and obviously
it's pretty easy then

1055
01:08:05.880 --> 01:08:08.680
to, you know, find excuses.

1056
01:08:15.200 --> 01:08:16.320
[COMMENTATOR]:
Deeney...

1057
01:08:16.400 --> 01:08:18.760
[CROWD CHEERS]
- ...that's it now"

1058
01:08:20.880 --> 01:08:23.920
It's a hugely significant result
for Watford

1059
01:08:24.240 --> 01:08:25.520
but for Liverpool

1060
01:08:25.800 --> 01:08:29.120
that long, long run
is about to come to an end.

1061
01:08:31.680 --> 01:08:34.400
[KLOPP]: I feel so much more
responsible

1062
01:08:34.600 --> 01:08:37.760
for defeats than for victories

1063
01:08:38.080 --> 01:08:39.080
because if we lose a game

1064
01:08:39.200 --> 01:08:41.400
I think my message
was not clear enough.

1065
01:08:41.760 --> 01:08:43.520
What we did in training
wasn't clear enough.

1066
01:08:43.600 --> 01:08:45.640
The boys didn't get it 100%.

1067
01:08:45.720 --> 01:08:46.760
It doesn't mean they are dumb.

1068
01:08:46.840 --> 01:08:48.840
That means
I have to be more clear.

1069
01:08:50.000 --> 01:08:52.280
[COMMENTATOR]: And so
Liverpool won't go unbeaten

1070
01:08:52.360 --> 01:08:54.120
all the way
in the Premier League.

1071
01:08:58.560 --> 01:09:00.040
We had not enough chances.

1072
01:09:00.320 --> 01:09:01.400
We didn't create enough.

1073
01:09:02.120 --> 01:09:04.560
And that's what you...
what leads them to a defeat.

1074
01:09:04.640 --> 01:09:05.640
That's how football is

1075
01:09:05.720 --> 01:09:07.960
and has nothing to do with
the games you won before

1076
01:09:08.040 --> 01:09:10.440
had nothing to do with
the games you will win.

1077
01:09:11.920 --> 01:09:13.440
It's just this one
football game

1078
01:09:13.520 --> 01:09:15.360
and for tonight,
we have to admit

1079
01:09:15.800 --> 01:09:18.280
that Watford was
the better team.

1080
01:09:26.440 --> 01:09:28.080
In the next moment,
pretty much

1081
01:09:28.760 --> 01:09:30.640
I realised, wow.

1082
01:09:31.520 --> 01:09:34.080
But we have we have
completely different problems.

1083
01:09:34.160 --> 01:09:35.880
It's a complete, well,
the world changed already.

1084
01:09:37.680 --> 01:09:40.800
[REPORTER]: Two patients from
the same family in England

1085
01:09:40.880 --> 01:09:43.400
have tested positive
for Coronavirus.

1086
01:09:43.680 --> 01:09:44.920
[REPORTER]:
In breaking news tonight

1087
01:09:45.000 --> 01:09:48.080
New Zealand has its first
confirmed case of Coronavirus.

1088
01:09:51.400 --> 01:09:53.840
[KLOPP]: I remember we played
against Bournemouth.

1089
01:09:53.920 --> 01:09:56.840
[CROWD CHEERS]

1090
01:09:57.480 --> 01:09:59.280
Twenty-five points now ahead.

1091
01:09:59.600 --> 01:10:02.040
A big gap, really a big gap.

1092
01:10:03.680 --> 01:10:07.040
City played the next day
and they lost against United.

1093
01:10:07.680 --> 01:10:09.280
[COMMENTATOR]:
Manchester United.

1094
01:10:09.360 --> 01:10:11.000
In the Manchester rain

1095
01:10:11.080 --> 01:10:13.000
are going to do
the double over city!

1096
01:10:13.800 --> 01:10:15.240
I remember
lying on the couch at home

1097
01:10:15.320 --> 01:10:17.640
and for us it was really, phew.

1098
01:10:19.640 --> 01:10:21.280
So I woke up Monday morning

1099
01:10:22.720 --> 01:10:25.640
and heard about Madrid closing
schools and universities.

1100
01:10:26.120 --> 01:10:31.240
[SHE SPEAKS SPANISH]

1101
01:10:32.320 --> 01:10:34.880
[KLOPP]: We had an incredibly
important Champion's League game

1102
01:10:35.280 --> 01:10:36.800
against Atletico Madrid.

1103
01:10:37.960 --> 01:10:39.480
I thought, OK, Madrid closing...

1104
01:10:39.960 --> 01:10:41.440
but there'll be five,
six thousand people

1105
01:10:41.520 --> 01:10:43.320
from Madrid tomorrow,
to the game.

1106
01:10:43.400 --> 01:10:44.800
That makes absolutely no sense.

1107
01:10:44.880 --> 01:10:46.440
But I had to go to
a press conference

1108
01:10:46.520 --> 01:10:49.320
and in this press conference,
a journalist asked me...

1109
01:10:49.560 --> 01:10:50.440
[PRESS]:
We come from Spain.

1110
01:10:50.520 --> 01:10:53.160
There's a lot of concerns about

1111
01:10:53.360 --> 01:10:55.600
they have closed schools
for 15 days.

1112
01:10:55.760 --> 01:10:57.600
Aren't you afraid that you

1113
01:10:58.080 --> 01:11:02.000
your players can get,
you know, exposed?

1114
01:11:05.200 --> 01:11:08.640
The ques- are you from Madrid?
Are you from Madrid?

1115
01:11:08.720 --> 01:11:10.160
[PRESS]: I'm from Argentina.
I live in Madrid.

1116
01:11:10.320 --> 01:11:12.360
Are you concerned in your city
they close...

1117
01:11:12.440 --> 01:11:13.800
[PRESS]: I'm not playing
football tomorrow.

1118
01:11:14.480 --> 01:11:16.320
That's exactly the thing
I don't like.

1119
01:11:16.400 --> 01:11:18.120
That you sit here
and ask me this question.

1120
01:11:18.200 --> 01:11:19.640
But fly from Madrid to here.

1121
01:11:19.880 --> 01:11:22.360
So stay there, they close
schools and universities.

1122
01:11:22.440 --> 01:11:24.560
But by... and you are obviously
concerned.

1123
01:11:24.800 --> 01:11:25.680
That's the question.

1124
01:11:25.760 --> 01:11:28.800
But because that's the moment
that I really get angry.

1125
01:11:28.880 --> 01:11:31.320
When you give me the feeling
I have a problem

1126
01:11:31.400 --> 01:11:32.280
which you don't have.

1127
01:11:32.640 --> 01:11:33.640
We have all the same problem.

1128
01:11:33.720 --> 01:11:34.920
[PRESS]: I'm not--
- It was exactly.

1129
01:11:35.000 --> 01:11:37.120
You said,
"But I don't play football".

1130
01:11:37.440 --> 01:11:39.200
That's only one,
that's only one part of the--

1131
01:11:39.280 --> 01:11:41.840
You talk everyday
to people from close range.

1132
01:11:41.920 --> 01:11:42.760
What I don't do.

1133
01:11:42.920 --> 01:11:44.920
Why are you here?
Ask me this question.

1134
01:11:45.000 --> 01:11:45.880
Stay at home.

1135
01:11:46.280 --> 01:11:49.400
So then, I have nothing to do.
I didn't organise this game.

1136
01:11:49.480 --> 01:11:51.120
I'm just part of it.

1137
01:11:51.320 --> 01:11:52.440
So, and of course
it was not

1138
01:11:52.520 --> 01:11:53.960
a normal Champion's League
game for us.

1139
01:11:54.360 --> 01:11:57.440
It was very difficult that night
to prepare a football game

1140
01:11:58.040 --> 01:12:01.280
and to ask the player to do
absolutely everything to win it

1141
01:12:01.360 --> 01:12:03.680
without knowing what will happen
the day after.

1142
01:12:04.000 --> 01:12:06.440
So we played this game,
played a really good game

1143
01:12:06.520 --> 01:12:08.720
but lost it,
went out of the competition.

1144
01:12:09.200 --> 01:12:10.520
I was, I remember

1145
01:12:10.760 --> 01:12:14.480
I was really angry about the way
Athletic Madrid played.

1146
01:12:14.560 --> 01:12:17.560
But five minutes later,
after all my interviews

1147
01:12:17.640 --> 01:12:19.880
I thought,
"What an idiot are you?

1148
01:12:20.280 --> 01:12:23.480
You worry about losing
a football game

1149
01:12:24.120 --> 01:12:27.120
but the world is in
a most difficult place ever".

1150
01:12:28.200 --> 01:12:32.160
So I drove home,
next day, training, coming in

1151
01:12:32.240 --> 01:12:34.920
it was already clear
the league will be stopped

1152
01:12:35.160 --> 01:12:38.280
and now we have to organise
the lockdown.

1153
01:12:39.400 --> 01:12:40.960
[REPORTER]: Much of
the football events in Europe

1154
01:12:41.040 --> 01:12:44.240
have been put on hold,
that includes the Premier League

1155
01:12:44.320 --> 01:12:46.160
and the Champions League
as well.

1156
01:12:48.920 --> 01:12:49.920
[GATE SLAMS]

1157
01:12:54.800 --> 01:12:56.880
[HENDERSON]:
So strange to be in the house

1158
01:12:56.960 --> 01:12:59.240
not knowing
what was going to happen.

1159
01:13:00.960 --> 01:13:02.960
When we were going to
go back to work.

1160
01:13:03.040 --> 01:13:05.640
When is that,
how bad is the virus?

1161
01:13:05.720 --> 01:13:06.800
You know, is it...

1162
01:13:07.920 --> 01:13:10.200
Who does it affect?
Loads of different things.

1163
01:13:13.360 --> 01:13:17.440
[IN PORTUGUESE]:

1164
01:13:23.640 --> 01:13:25.640
[KLOPP]: The whole club
had to do an incredible job

1165
01:13:26.040 --> 01:13:31.800
to keep these high-profile boys
in a safe place.

1166
01:13:32.640 --> 01:13:37.120
The only thing you can do
outside is going food shopping.

1167
01:13:37.480 --> 01:13:40.000
But that's really difficult
for a professional

1168
01:13:40.080 --> 01:13:41.680
very famous football player.

1169
01:13:43.640 --> 01:13:48.000
[MANE IN FRENCH]

1170
01:14:05.400 --> 01:14:09.680
[PRESENTER]:
12107, 30076.

1171
01:14:09.760 --> 01:14:15.480
Total number of deaths
stands at 40597.

1172
01:14:18.480 --> 01:14:22.960
[IN PORTUGUESE]:

1173
01:14:35.960 --> 01:14:36.800
Hi guys.

1174
01:14:36.880 --> 01:14:40.000
I have accepted the challenge
from WHO.

1175
01:14:40.240 --> 01:14:41.640
The safe hands challenge.

1176
01:14:41.960 --> 01:14:45.320
So try to follow the steps
to clean my hands properly.

1177
01:14:46.120 --> 01:14:49.720
[IN PORTUGUESE]

1178
01:15:05.800 --> 01:15:07.760
[KLOPP]:
I learn a lot of new things.

1179
01:15:08.480 --> 01:15:10.280
I'm now
in charge of dishwashing

1180
01:15:10.600 --> 01:15:13.240
which is nice, actually,
I enjoy it.

1181
01:15:13.320 --> 01:15:17.000
I can, I am master of
that little machine now

1182
01:15:17.320 --> 01:15:21.640
and I did
my first scrambled eggs.

1183
01:15:22.080 --> 01:15:24.600
[WOMAN IN PORTUGUESE]:

1184
01:15:33.440 --> 01:15:35.400
[HE LAUGHS]

1185
01:15:35.680 --> 01:15:37.400
The challenge for next week is

1186
01:15:38.000 --> 01:15:41.120
I'm 52 now
and I cannot tie a tie.

1187
01:15:42.440 --> 01:15:46.120
After this week,
I should be able to tie a tie.

1188
01:15:46.640 --> 01:15:49.760
We have a very big
WhatsApp group in the team

1189
01:15:49.960 --> 01:15:51.280
we're sharing everything

1190
01:15:51.360 --> 01:15:54.400
so we always keep in touch
every day.

1191
01:15:55.160 --> 01:15:56.920
[KLOPP]:
Look at him. You look great!

1192
01:15:57.120 --> 01:15:59.200
[HENDERSON]:
I felt in that moment

1193
01:15:59.280 --> 01:16:01.280
we just showed
the togetherness.

1194
01:16:01.600 --> 01:16:03.360
You know, how close we are
as a group.

1195
01:16:04.200 --> 01:16:07.160
Someone was feeling
a bit down or whatever.

1196
01:16:07.280 --> 01:16:08.200
Pick the phone up

1197
01:16:08.480 --> 01:16:11.880
or on Zoom calls
doing sessions together.

1198
01:16:12.200 --> 01:16:13.200
[SALAH]:
Morning everyone.

1199
01:16:13.720 --> 01:16:16.360
[KLOPP]:
Morning!

1200
01:16:18.960 --> 01:16:19.840
[THEY LAUGH]

1201
01:16:35.520 --> 01:16:38.600
Naby you look so nice
with the bald head!

1202
01:16:39.920 --> 01:16:42.880
[KLOPP]: We should start
singing, huh? Sadio's birthday.

1203
01:16:43.360 --> 01:16:44.680
[WIJNALDUM]:
It's your birthday?

1204
01:16:45.360 --> 01:16:46.280
[MANE]:
Yes, Gini.

1205
01:16:48.000 --> 01:16:50.600
Come on, a quick one.
I'm only in for the singing.

1206
01:16:50.680 --> 01:16:53.280
[THEY SING HAPPY BIRTHDAY]

1207
01:16:59.760 --> 01:17:00.800
You have to be
very professional.

1208
01:17:00.880 --> 01:17:04.680
You have to make sure that
you are doing the right things

1209
01:17:04.760 --> 01:17:05.440
and staying fit.

1210
01:17:06.400 --> 01:17:08.000
[RYDINGS]: Shall we see
who's going to finish last?

1211
01:17:09.040 --> 01:17:11.040
Come on, Trent. Come on,
Trent, we are all watching!

1212
01:17:11.400 --> 01:17:14.040
Shock.
T is knackered!

1213
01:17:14.560 --> 01:17:15.960
[ALEXANDER- ARNOLD]: I couldn't
get the ball on me neck!

1214
01:17:16.440 --> 01:17:18.880
Just scrawn and bone.
No muscle that's why.

1215
01:17:19.240 --> 01:17:20.760
You know,
at one point you just accept it

1216
01:17:20.840 --> 01:17:24.200
and wait for the for the right
moment to kick on again.

1217
01:17:24.520 --> 01:17:27.200
I miss everybody.
I just miss everybody.

1218
01:17:34.640 --> 01:17:37.040
Good evening, plans to ease
parts of the lockdown

1219
01:17:37.120 --> 01:17:40.400
have been put on hold after
an increase in COVID infections.

1220
01:17:40.880 --> 01:17:43.240
Christian, are you confident

1221
01:17:43.320 --> 01:17:46.560
that the Premier League season
will go ahead?

1222
01:17:46.640 --> 01:17:48.280
None of us know.
We'll see.

1223
01:17:48.360 --> 01:17:50.840
[INDISTINCT CHATTER]

1224
01:17:50.920 --> 01:17:52.680
We have no idea.
Let's hope so.

1225
01:17:53.040 --> 01:17:54.000
[PRESENTER]:
A lot of speculation

1226
01:17:54.080 --> 01:17:56.200
about how the Premier League
is going to finish.

1227
01:17:56.400 --> 01:17:59.440
This is what Rio Ferdinand
had to say on Instagram

1228
01:17:59.520 --> 01:18:02.280
"I just think the Premier
League should be void".

1229
01:18:02.440 --> 01:18:05.040
Should we actually
still be pretending

1230
01:18:05.320 --> 01:18:06.800
that everything is normal

