where they belong.

1476
01:31:23.160 --> 01:31:26.600
[THEY CHEER]

1477
01:31:26.680 --> 01:31:29.880
[COMMENTATOR]:
Champions again, Liverpool!

1478
01:31:37.440 --> 01:31:39.000
[KLOPP]:
Absolutely incredible.

1479
01:31:39.560 --> 01:31:40.880
It's an incredible moment.

1480
01:31:41.320 --> 01:31:43.560
Obviously, my coaches are
really in a good mood.

1481
01:31:43.640 --> 01:31:45.640
I like that. So, yeah.

1482
01:31:45.720 --> 01:31:47.760
No, all perfect.
Absolutely perfect night.

1483
01:31:48.120 --> 01:31:50.240
Let me say it again:
without crowd

1484
01:31:50.520 --> 01:31:51.640
it's not the same.

1485
01:31:51.880 --> 01:31:55.160
But, you know, we only do it
for you. We know it.

1486
01:31:55.240 --> 01:31:57.240
And we will have a time
we will do it together.

1487
01:31:57.400 --> 01:31:59.120
Congratulations to all of us.

1488
01:31:59.200 --> 01:32:02.000
We are Champions of England,
Europe and the world

1489
01:32:02.120 --> 01:32:03.560
because of you,
by the way.

1490
01:32:03.640 --> 01:32:09.080
[CROWD CHEERS]

1491
01:32:12.080 --> 01:32:14.680
[THEY CHEER AND WHISTLE]

1492
01:32:16.760 --> 01:32:18.120
[THEY LAUGH]

1493
01:32:58.800 --> 01:33:02.040
Winning trophies is pretty much
the holy grail

1494
01:33:02.280 --> 01:33:04.400
for everybody
involved in sports.

1495
01:33:06.560 --> 01:33:10.560
We won the league,
but now we go for the next one.

1496
01:33:11.320 --> 01:33:12.160
Wow.

1497
01:33:12.960 --> 01:33:17.160
We have to show that we are
ready to fight for each yard

1498
01:33:17.240 --> 01:33:20.520
and for each result out there
and that's what I expect.

1499
01:33:24.200 --> 01:33:26.000
[INTERVIEWER]:

1500
01:33:26.200 --> 01:33:27.600
[HE LAUGHS]

1501
01:33:28.480 --> 01:33:30.640
Yeah, not bad, not bad.

1502
01:33:31.720 --> 01:33:34.040
No, I'm fine with the title
and I don't need another one.

1503
01:33:34.120 --> 01:33:35.400
That's great.

1504
01:33:35.600 --> 01:33:37.200
The problem is
it's exactly that.

1505
01:33:37.640 --> 01:33:39.200
There was a long, long storm.

1506
01:33:39.520 --> 01:33:41.120
Rainy days
and all that stuff.

1507
01:33:41.880 --> 01:33:43.640
Big, great people tried it

1508
01:33:44.160 --> 01:33:47.920
and we were blessed to be
the ones to finally get it.

1509
01:33:49.720 --> 01:33:51.760
[MUSIC:
"You'll Never Walk Alone"]

1510
01:33:51.800 --> 01:33:53.400
[by Rodgers and Hammerstein]

1511
01:33:54.480 --> 01:33:57.320
[SUNG BY: Lana Del Rey]

1512
01:33:58.080 --> 01:34:03.760
♪ When you walk
through a storm ♪

1513
01:34:05.240 --> 01:34:10.760
♪ Hold your head
up high ♪

1514
01:34:12.280 --> 01:34:21.080
♪ And don't be afraid
of the dark ♪

1515
01:34:24.360 --> 01:34:28.960
♪ At the end of a storm ♪

1516
01:34:29.520 --> 01:34:34.640
♪ There's a golden sky ♪

1517
01:34:35.720 --> 01:34:44.080
♪ And the sweet silver song
of a lark ♪

1518
01:34:47.680 --> 01:34:51.920
♪ Walk on through the wind ♪

1519
01:34:52.640 --> 01:34:57.080
♪ Walk on through the rain ♪

1520
01:34:58.200 --> 01:35:07.800
♪ Though your dreams
be tossed and blown ♪

1521
01:35:08.400 --> 01:35:14.760
♪ Walk on, walk on ♪

1522
01:35:15.320 --> 01:35:19.640
♪ With hope in your heart ♪

1523
01:35:20.440 --> 01:35:29.720
♪ And you'll never walk alone ♪

1524
01:35:33.440 --> 01:35:43.040
♪ You'll never walk alone ♪

1525
01:35:45.680 --> 01:35:53.240
[MEN CONTINUE THE SONG]

1526
01:35:53.320 --> 01:35:55.720
[MANE IN FRENCH]:

1527
01:36:10.320 --> 01:36:11.600
[DOM]:
When you have tough times

1528
01:36:12.760 --> 01:36:14.360
you stand with people
and you'll get through it.

1529
01:36:14.800 --> 01:36:17.080
[ANTHEM CONTINUES]

1530
01:36:19.080 --> 01:36:21.720
[SPEAKING PORTUGUESE]

1531
01:36:31.240 --> 01:36:33.440
[DALGLISH]:
The song means community.

1532
01:36:35.880 --> 01:36:40.480
It has the same meaning
whether it's 50, 60 thousand

1533
01:36:41.280 --> 01:36:42.920
whether it's an empty stadium.

1534
01:36:45.240 --> 01:36:46.360
And at this time, it's more

1535
01:36:46.440 --> 01:36:47.440
apparent than it's ever been.

1536
01:36:47.800 --> 01:36:53.360
[ANTHEM CONTINUES]

1537
01:36:53.440 --> 01:36:55.000
[LAURICE]:
Everyone needs to come together.

1538
01:36:56.680 --> 01:36:59.760
It takes a world to come
together to make a change.

1539
01:37:10.640 --> 01:37:12.920
You never walk alone
is exactly that.

1540
01:37:17.320 --> 01:37:18.960
We all need to walk together

1541
01:37:19.160 --> 01:37:20.640
to make the world
a better place.

1542
01:37:24.880 --> 01:37:26.120
[VAN DIJK]:
It's an incredible song.

1543
01:37:27.360 --> 01:37:28.880
It's a very special anthem

1544
01:37:30.000 --> 01:37:31.080
and it's our anthem.

1545
01:37:33.280 --> 01:37:39.160
♪ Walk on, walk on ♪

1546
01:37:39.720 --> 01:37:44.520
♪ With hope in your heart ♪

1547
01:37:45.680 --> 01:37:54.560
♪ And you'll never walk alone ♪

1548
01:37:57.680 --> 01:38:03.240
♪ You'll never walk...

1549
01:38:04.760 --> 01:38:09.160
alone ♪
